                                                        <div>4.3. In agreements requiring the Client to retain equipment necessary for the Supplier’s work, the Client shall be responsible for safeguarding and storing such equipment. In the event of any damage, the Supplier shall be entitled to investigate through the Client and the monitoring systems. If it is established that the damage was caused by the Client, the cost of the damage shall be calculated and charged to the Client as compensation.</div>
