                                                        <div class="mb-2">8.3. Except as provided in Clause 8.2, the Supplier shall be liable only for obligations arising from its performance of services, specifically relating to: (a) physical damage to property caused by the Supplier’s negligence or error in providing the services; or (b) failure to provide the services in accordance with the Agreement or the Quotation.</div>
                                                        <div class="mb-2">8.4. The Client shall: (a) take all reasonable steps to mitigate its losses; and (b) notify the Supplier of any complaint regarding the service within thirty (30) days of the provision of the relevant service or any part thereof, so that the Supplier may investigate it.</div>
                                                        <div>8.5. Subject to Clauses 8.1 to 8.6, the Supplier shall exclude all liabilities to the maximum extent permitted by law.</div>
